@startuml
title Document Knowledge 내부 capability 구조
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "Document Knowledge 내부 package capability" {
  class RuleKnowledgeController
  class HybridEvidenceSearchService {
    +EvidenceSearchResult search(EvidenceSearchRequest request)
  }
  interface DenseEvidenceCandidateSearchPort
  interface Bm25EvidenceCandidateSearchPort
  class PgvectorDenseEvidenceCandidateSearchAdapter
  class PostgreSQLBm25EvidenceCandidateSearchAdapter
  class RrfFusionPolicy {
    +List<EvidenceCandidate> fuse(List<EvidenceCandidate> dense, List<EvidenceCandidate> bm25)
  }
  class EvidenceSearchRequest
  class EvidenceSearchResult
  class EvidenceCandidate
  class RagExtractionPublicationService {
    +void publish(...)
  }
  class PublicationRepository
  class PublishedRagChunk {
    document_length
  }
  class ChunkTermFrequency
}

RuleKnowledgeController --> HybridEvidenceSearchService : UC-HR-001 / 검색 요청
HybridEvidenceSearchService --> DenseEvidenceCandidateSearchPort : Dense 최대 30
HybridEvidenceSearchService --> Bm25EvidenceCandidateSearchPort : BM25 최대 30
DenseEvidenceCandidateSearchPort <|.. PgvectorDenseEvidenceCandidateSearchAdapter
Bm25EvidenceCandidateSearchPort <|.. PostgreSQLBm25EvidenceCandidateSearchAdapter
HybridEvidenceSearchService --> RrfFusionPolicy : RRF k=60
HybridEvidenceSearchService ..> EvidenceSearchRequest
HybridEvidenceSearchService ..> EvidenceSearchResult
EvidenceSearchResult o-- EvidenceCandidate

RagExtractionPublicationService --> PublicationRepository : atomic publication
PublicationRepository --> PublishedRagChunk : vector + document_length
PublicationRepository --> ChunkTermFrequency : term frequency
note right of PublicationRepository
vector + BM25 terms + status를 같은 transaction으로 커밋한다.
둘 다 완료될 때만 INDEXED 소유권을 부여한다.
end note
note bottom of HybridEvidenceSearchService
BR-HR-001~004 / AC-HR-001~004
Document Knowledge가 검색·RRF·출처와 색인 원자성을 소유한다.
배포는 existing rule-knowledge-service를 유지한다.
end note
@enduml
